# Reference only: MatchEyes reads these from the process environment; nothing loads a .env file.
# Never commit real values. The public web surface never calls a model and needs none of these.

# Optional model-backed reasoner (off by default; the rule-based reference reasoner is used
# otherwise). Used only by local CLI runs and evaluations (`investigate --llm`, `eval llm`).
#
# Endpoint: the Microsoft Foundry / Azure OpenAI v1 base URL, e.g.
#   https://<resource>.openai.azure.com/openai/v1/
# (the chat-completions path is appended), or a full https chat-completions URL.
# MATCHEYES_LLM_ENDPOINT=
#
# Model: the deployment name (sent as `model`).
# MATCHEYES_LLM_MODEL=
#
# Auth: "api-key" (Azure key header), "bearer" (OpenAI-style key) or "entra"
# (Microsoft Entra ID via DefaultAzureCredential: az login locally; needs the optional
# `azure` extra and the "Cognitive Services OpenAI User" role; no key).
# MATCHEYES_LLM_AUTH=api-key
#
# Key: required for "api-key" and "bearer", unused for "entra".
# MATCHEYES_LLM_API_KEY=
